WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.923
Open Workflows from the sidebar

00:00:02.923 --> 00:00:05.272
Active workflows can run; drafts are still in progress

00:00:05.272 --> 00:00:08.624
Open a workflow to see its blocks

00:00:08.624 --> 00:00:10.825
Each block is a step: call, branch, act, wait, message

00:00:10.825 --> 00:00:15.391
Every publish is a version; one is live

00:00:15.391 --> 00:00:16.830
Every run is recorded in Logs → Workflows

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.688
Filter runs by status or workflow

00:00:19.688 --> 00:00:23.709
Click a run to see the path it took

00:00:23.709 --> 00:00:26.662
Click the Agent step to open its call

00:00:26.662 --> 00:00:31.129
Recording, analysis and evals for that call

00:00:31.129 --> 00:00:36.231
A Conditional step shows the branch the run took

00:00:36.231 --> 00:00:44.385
A failed step shows the error that stopped the run

00:00:44.385 --> 00:00:48.885
Click a run's call count to see its calls in Logs
